{
  "title": "Lovely Smoky Greek Chickpeas Revithia",
  "description": "A smoky and chewy Greek dish featuring truffle oil, this crowd-pleaser is cooked to perfection in a clay pot and is FODMAP-friendly.",
  "cuisine": "Greek",
  "diet": [
